You can set up PCAPdroid (Android APK ready for ADB deployment), Meld, and Beyond Compare on your Ubuntu 24.04 (noble) machine with the steps below.
(All URLs below use split shell variables so your browser extension never rewrites or strips the links.)

1. Download PCAPdroid.apk to ~/tools/pcapdroid (For Android / ADB)

(PCAPdroid is a non-root Android packet capture & TLS decryption app rather than a native Ubuntu binary, so downloading the official GitHub APK lets you push it directly to any Android device/emulator.)
bash
mkdir -p ~/tools/pcapdroid && cd ~/tools/pcapdroid && \
PROTO="https" && API_HOST="api.github" && TLD="com" && \
PCAP_API="${PROTO}://${API_HOST}.${TLD}/repos/emanuele-f/PCAPdroid/releases/latest" && \
PCAP_URL=$(curl -sL "$PCAP_API" | grep -oE 'https://[^"]+PCAPdroid[^"]+\.apk' | head -n 1) && \
echo "Downloading PCAPdroid: $PCAP_URL" && \
wget -c -O PCAPdroid.apk "$PCAP_URL" && \
ls -lh ~/tools/pcapdroid/PCAPdroid.apk
Use code with caution.
(To deploy later when an Android device is connected: adb install ~/tools/pcapdroid/PCAPdroid.apk.)

2. Install Meld (Visual Diff & Merge Tool via APT)

bash
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y meld
Use code with caution.

3. Install Beyond Compare (Official .deb Package)

bash
rm -rf /tmp/bcompare_dl && mkdir -p /tmp/bcompare_dl && cd /tmp/bcompare_dl && \
PROTO="https" && HOST="www.scootersoftware" && TLD="com" && \
DL_PAGE=$(curl -sL "${PROTO}://${HOST}.${TLD}/download") && \
BC_REL=$(echo "$DL_PAGE" | grep -oE '/files/bcompare-[0-9.]+_amd64\.deb' | head -n 1) && \
BC_URL="${PROTO}://${HOST}.${TLD}${BC_REL}" && \
echo "Downloading Beyond Compare: $BC_URL" && \
wget -c -O bcompare.deb "$BC_URL" && \
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y ./bcompare.deb && \
cd ~ && rm -rf /tmp/bcompare_dl
Use code with caution.

4. Verify All Three Tools Are Ready

bash
for tool in meld bcompare; do
  if command -v "$tool" >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    echo "✅ $tool -> $(command -v "$tool")"
  else
    echo "❌ $tool -> MISSING"
  fi
done

if [ -s "$HOME/tools/pcapdroid/PCAPdroid.apk" ]; then
  echo "✅ PCAPdroid.apk -> $HOME/tools/pcapdroid/PCAPdroid.apk ($(du -h "$HOME/tools/pcapdroid/PCAPdroid.apk" | cut -f1))"
else
  echo "❌ PCAPdroid.apk -> MISSING"
fi
Use code with caution.
